re and something that, again, within that context, continue to look at our overall physical network in terms of branch size, number of branches, locations, etc. But at this point, I don't see any major restructuring that we need to do to the branch network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2021 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"We believe that the cost savings of 45% we projected at the time we announced the acquisition will be fully achieved in 2022, which is faster than originally anticipated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/30/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2021 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2022-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"…related to Century were $30.7 million in the quarter and are outlined in Appendix H. As we mentioned last quarter, we look forward to leveraging our operating platform post-acquisition and are confident that 45% cost savings we outlined at the time of the acquisition will be realized in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/28/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q4-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2022 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"But expenses are in line with our guidance from last quarter and reflect the cost savings of 45% that we expected at the time we announced the Century acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2022 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Rivers","x":"…this call was that for every 25 basis points increase in rates, we would have at that time, we said we'd anticipate $8 million of incremental net interest income with some of the balance sheet restructuring, is that down a little bit, but I would say it's $7 million for a 25 basis point increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2022 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2022-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"Inclusive of that change, we maintain our outlook for operating non-interest income in the $180 million to $190 million range in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2022 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2022-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"We talked on the last call about the tightening market for deposits and that we expected price increases in a challenging market going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/28/eastern-bankshares-inc-ebc-q3-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EBC 2023 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2024-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Rivers","x":"We responded quickly and boldly into this environment by restructuring our first -- restructuring our securities portfolio in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/26/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q4-2023-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2024-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"I think on the cost savings side, we're expected to be slightly higher than what we articulated last September.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/26/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q1-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q2","e":"ebc","d":"2024-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"We incurred $700,000 of severance and early retirement expenses and $900,000 of occupancy expenses related to our move to our new corporate headquarters, which was completed in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/26/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q2-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q2","e":"ebc","d":"2024-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Fitzgerald","x":"For expenses, we removed the FDIC special assessment, the severance and early retirement amount, and the headquarters moving costs, which results in core noninterest expenses of $102 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/26/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q2-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2024-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"We outperformed the original guidance on deal charges, earnings per share accretion, and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/25/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q3-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2024-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damon Delmonte","x":"And then also, do you have any thoughts on potential securities restructuring, just given the greater capital flexibility?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/25/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q3-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2025-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Rosato","x":"That's why that portfolio yields, as I said, in the mid-180s pre-restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q4-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2024 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2025-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damon Delmonte","x":"Since this is taking place -- the restructuring is taking place here, midway through the first quarter, do you expect to kind of split the benefit from the restructuring on the margin in the first quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q4-2024-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"EBC 2025 Q2","e":"ebc","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"Damon, so it's a combination of both, and what I would say is seeing, you know, while there still is some concern about economic volatility with tariffs and trade policy, etcetera, we're seeing increasing confidence from our customer base and in the market broadly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2025 Q2","e":"ebc","d":"2025-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Rosato","x":"With that said and based on interest rates, we do have the capital to pursue another restructuring but it's a little bit on the back burner right now just because of the merger and the fact that our current authorization expires at the end of the month.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2025 Q2","e":"ebc","d":"2025-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Damon DelMonte","x":"And then secondly, on the margin and the outlook, appreciate the reaffirmed guidance there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2025 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2026-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"We are committed to rightsizing our capital through organic growth, share repurchases and quarterly dividends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/eastern-ebc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2025 Q4","e":"ebc","d":"2026-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"R. Rosato","x":"As Denis stated earlier, we are committed to rightsizing capital through organic growth, share repurchases and quarterly dividends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/eastern-ebc-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2026-04-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"Before turning the call over to David, I wanted to spend a moment on artificial intelligence, a topic we are frequently asked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/ebc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2026-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"Given our profitability, we continue to generate capital in excess of our growth needs, we remain focused on rightsizing our capital through a combination of organic growth, share repurchases and quarterly dividends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/ebc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2026-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"Importantly, we remain on track to capture the merger's targeted cost savings and onetime charges are largely complete with approximately $2 million remaining in the second quarter, bringing the total to $67 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/ebc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q1","e":"ebc","d":"2026-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Denis Sheahan","x":"So there's -- admittedly, there's a little bit of conservatism in not lowering the guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/24/ebc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2026-10-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Rosato","x":"We have seen tech AI spend go up this year modestly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2026-10-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Rosato","x":"But we don't think the tech AI spend is we're going to be sitting here in January delivering bad news on the expense line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/eastern-bankshares-ebc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EBC 2026 Q3","e":"ebc","d":"2026-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s"